</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thorn-crowned His blessed head,</l><l>Blood-stained His every tread;</l><l>Cross-laden He was led,</l><l>For me! for me!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Pierced His hands and feet,</l><l>Three hours o’er Him beat</l><l>Fierce rays of noon-tide heat,</l><l>For me! for me!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thus wert Thou made all mine;</l><l>Lord, make me wholly Thine;</l><l>Grant grace and strength divine</l><l>To me! to me!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>In thought and word and deed,</l><l>Thy will to do, O lead</l><l>My soul, e’en though it bleed,</l><l>To Thee, to Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
